<!doctype html><html lang="sk"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>WDFOX Jarvis CRM – architektúra</title><style>:root{color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#143342,#06090e 55%);color:#edf9ff;font:16px system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:28px 18px 70px}nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}nav a{color:#a5f1d3;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3e6673;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:22px}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem);color:#9ee9d1}h2{color:#9ee9d1}p,li{color:#bbccd6;line-height:1.65}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px}.card,.stage{background:#0f1d27;border:1px solid #365866;border-radius:16px;padding:20px}.flow{text-align:center;max-width:740px;margin:28px auto}.flow div{padding:15px;border:1px solid #4b7a76;border-radius:12px;background:#12252d}.flow span{display:block;padding:7px;color:#a2c6c4}.stages{display:grid;gap:12px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#0a151d;border:1px solid #3a5867;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;color:#d4e6ed;font:inherit;line-height:1.6}.notice{margin:20px 0;border-left:3px solid #9ee9d1;padding:15px;background:#10212b}@media(max-width:720px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><nav><a href="/system-design">🌳 Hlavná mapa</a><a href="/system-design/ai-tools">🧰 Tool Vault</a><a href="/system-design/communication">💬 Komunikácia</a></nav><h1>🦊 WDFOX Jarvis CRM</h1><p>Plán vlastného CRM systému s AI riadiacim asistentom, hlasovým a textovým ovládaním, orchestráciou agentov a voliteľným denným telefonickým briefingom.</p><div class="flow"><div>👤 Majiteľ / klient: hlas alebo text</div><span>↓</span><div>🧠 Jarvis Supervisor + Context Engine</div><span>↓</span><div>🔀 n8n + MCP / API + schvaľovanie akcií</div><span>↓</span><div>📇 CRM • Outlook • kalendár • Tawk.to • voice • marketing</div